# 📊 MessKhojo Google Sheets Two-Way Sync — Implementation Plan

> **Objective**: Enable a manual, two-way sync between MessKhojo's website database (Firestore) and a central Google Sheet.
> - **Direction 1 (Website ➔ Google Sheet)**: Syncs all mess details into Google Sheets with **zero duplicates** (smart upsert: updates existing messes in-place, appends only newly registered messes).
> - **Direction 2 (Google Sheet ➔ Website)**: Any manual edits made in the sheet (phone, rent, vacancy, facilities) can be synced back to the live website with **a single click and diff preview** from the Operational Dashboard.
> - **Cost & Complexity**: **100% Free**, zero cloud billing, no complex Google Cloud IAM/service accounts needed.

